Subject: Your Digital Access & Security Settings
A periodic summary of non-sensitive digital settings is provided below. Sign-in methods:
- biometric login enabled;
- passcode fallback active;
- 2-factor authentication set to authenticator app.
Device profile:
- mobile app usage on recent Android and iOS versions;
- web sessions active during weekday mornings.
Alerts:
- security notifications on;
- low-balance alerts off;
- card-present decline alerts on.
Personalization:
- product tips enabled;
- cashback insights enabled;
- investment content muted.
Location & travel:
- travel notice feature available;
- location-assisted approvals permitted while roaming.
Spending insights:
- monthly categories tracked include groceries, transport, and subscriptions;
- round-up savings enabled.
These preferences can be adjusted at any time in Settings ▸ Security, Notifications, and Personalization.

Subject: Review of Your Profile & Preferences
This is a reminder to confirm the profile and preference settings held for this banking relationship. Current attributes on file:
- preferred language set to Igbo;
- communication channels enabled for email and in-app, disabled for SMS and voice;
- statement delivery set to paperless;
- marketing consent active for product education and rewards, inactive for third-party offers;
- age band recorded as 32;
- household size recorded as 2–3;
- employment sector listed as Financial Analyst;
- income range recorded as 40k–60k;
- residency recorded within the Ethiopian;
- financial goals tagged as “short-term savings” and “travel fund”;
- risk appetite marked “moderate”;
- budgeting category alerts enabled for groceries and transport.
If these settings remain accurate, no action is required.
To change any item, visit Preferences ▸ Profile & Consent.

